Step 6: Building a Team Collaboration Dashboard

Core Prompt:
Build a complete task management dashboard for a team collaboration tool. Include a project overview, team member avatars, task progress charts, recent activity feed, and quick action buttons. Integrate all components into a cohesive interface with proper state management and responsive design.

Key Features:
1. Project Overview
    Real-time metrics display
    Progress indicators
    Status badges
    Trend indicators

2. Team Members Section
    Team member avatars
    Online status indicators
    Role badges
    Quick contact actions

3. Progress Charts
    Task completion visualization
    Project milestones
    Timeline view

4. Activity Feed
    Recent team activities
    Timestamp display
    Activity type icons
    User attribution

5. Quick actions
    Create new task
    Add team member
    Generate report
    Schedule meeting

State management patterns:
    Local state with useState for UI interactions
    Context API for shared state (theme, user)
    Props drilling for component communication
    Event handlers for user interactions

Integration points:
    When task is completed: update stats + progress chart + activity feed
    When team member is added: update team section + activity feed
    Theme toggle: update all components

